 ___[ Navigating Directories ]_____________________________________|
|                                                                  |
|  pwd             --- Shows current working directory             |
|  cd <folder>     --- Changes to specified folder                 |
|  cd ..           --- Moves up to parent folder                   |
|  cd \            --- Moves to root directory                     |
|  cd D:\<folder>  --- Switches active drive and enters folder     |
|  dir             --- Lists files and details in directory        |
|  tree            --- Displays graphical directory tree structure |
|  cls             --- Clears the terminal screen                  |
|__________________________________________________________________|
